                        "username": "branupama"
                    },
                    "message": "The TODO was left intentionally because updating m_frusCount requires the corresponding asynchronous tracking/decrement flow to be fully integrated. Incrementing the count here without completing that flow would prevent processChassisResults() from reaching its completion condition and returning. For this commit, I kept the existing completion behavior intact and deferred FRU count tracking to a follow-up change."
