                    "message": "We can save the size of the map in a variable here and use it for the empty check at line 224 and the size use at line 232. \n\nThough unlikely, but if the chassis to motherboard EEPROM map becomes empty in between line 224 and 232, it will result in a divide by zero at line 232."
