                    "reviewer": {
                        "name": "Souvik Roy",
                        "email": "souvikroyofficial10@gmail.com",
                        "username": "souvik1914581"
                    },
                    "message": "Instead of an infinite loop and then checking for exit conditions at line 251 using `m_chassisCount` and `m_frusCount`, we can keep the loop running condition as\n\n`while(m_chassisCount || m_frusCount)`\n\nThis makes it clear that the loop runs till there are no more chassis or frus to process and also reduces LOC."
                },
                {
                    "file": "vpd-manager/src/thread_manager.cpp",
                    "line": 234,
                    "reviewer": {
                        "name": "Anupama B R",
                        "email": "anupama.b.r1@ibm.com",
                        "username": "branupama"
                    },
                    "message": "no need to iterate loop until all the m_chassisCount and m_frusCount count decremented to zero every time, conditional_variable will block the execution until condition met."
                },
                {
                    "file": "vpd-manager/src/thread_manager.cpp",
