                    "reviewer": {
                        "name": "Souvik Roy",
                        "email": "souvikroyofficial10@gmail.com",
                        "username": "souvik1914581"
                    },
                    "message": "If some chassis is absent, should we have an `else` block and log a message so that it is clear that we are skipping FRUs collection pool for that chassis?"
                },
                {
                    "file": "vpd-manager/src/thread_manager.cpp",
                    "line": 265,
                    "reviewer": {
                        "name": "Anupama B R",
                        "email": "anupama.b.r1@ibm.com",
                        "username": "branupama"
                    },
                    "message": "the log when chassis is absent is done as a part of parseAndPublish worker api. No need to add duplicate logs"
                },
